@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #294B63
skinparam participantBorderColor #294B63
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #EAF5F3

actor "腕表或设备网关" as Device
participant "DeviceIngestController" as Controller
participant "DeviceAccessService" as Access
participant "GeoService" as Geo
database "MySQL" as DB

Device -> Controller: POST /api/device/v1/locations\nX-Device-Id + X-Device-Key + eventId
Controller -> Access: 校验设备状态与密钥摘要
Access -> DB: 查询设备与 key_hash
DB --> Access: 设备身份
Access --> Controller: 认证通过
Controller -> Geo: ingestDeviceLocation(deviceId, payload)
Geo -> DB: 按 deviceId + eventId 查重
alt 同事件同内容重传
  DB --> Geo: 已存在定位点
  Geo --> Controller: 返回既有结果
else 同事件不同内容
  Geo --> Controller: 409 冲突
else 新定位事件
  Geo -> DB: 查发生时有效绑定并写 location_point
  Geo -> DB: 锁定围栏监测状态并计算球面距离
  alt 首次越界
    Geo -> DB: 创建 geofence_alert 并更新 active_alert_id
  else 返回围栏
    Geo -> DB: 写 returned_at 并复位状态
  end
  Geo --> Controller: 定位和告警处理结果
end
Controller --> Device: 200 或明确错误码
@enduml
